  "product": {
    "id": 8325454921982,
    "title": "M9 Gaming Stick: New 2.4G Double Wireless Controller Game Stick - 4K Resolution, 10,000 Retro Games, 64GB Storage - Perfect TV Boy Gift with Dual Controllers!",
    "body_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\">in stock, ships in 24-48 hours</span></strong></p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Introducing the M9 Video Game Console, your gateway to a world of gaming nostalgia. Dive into an unparalleled gaming experience with these outstanding features:</p>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">4K Resolution:</strong> Immerse yourself in stunning visuals with the 4K resolution display, ensuring every pixel is crisp and clear for an unbeatable gaming adventure.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">10,000 Games:</strong> With a vast library of over 10,000 games, boredom becomes a thing of the past. Explore a plethora of gaming options that promise endless entertainment for hours on end.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Portable Design:</strong> Take your gaming anywhere with the M9's portable design. Whether you're traveling or lounging on the couch, this console is your perfect companion for gaming on-the-go.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Wireless Connectivity:</strong> Say goodbye to tangled cords with the M9's wireless connectivity feature. Utilizing advanced 2.4G technology, effortlessly connect to your TV for hassle-free setup and uninterrupted gameplay.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Specification Parameters:</strong></p>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Operating System:</strong> Linux Retroarchiopen Source System</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Language:</strong> Supports Multi-languages</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Emulator:</strong> MAME/FC/GB/MD/SFC/PS/ATAR|2600/ATAR|7800</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Sdram:</strong> DDR3 256MB</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Flash:</strong> 128MB</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Package Includes:</strong></p>\n<ul data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1 * USB Receiver</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1 * Power Line</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1 * HD Cable</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">1 * Gaming Stick</li>\n<li data-mce-fragment=\"1\">2 * Gamepad</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Elevate your gaming experience and relive the classics with the M9 Video Game Console.</p>\n<p data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczM3YpAAa6dYzArwGA2yz51WU7WhmlT5lGPksn8N9E72etkbuClcmK_v50vGOZ8Vctatzx1MTY_Ywk_uC-D2F97up2KFdWu7SwFUAbQgoxDgD2IvTmnvfYUwvSVh2FqEIjVT13z3OlUP4IbZb4mLfQyg=w1384-h1384-s-no-gm?authuser=2\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPttsRQgfE5_sD7qctDUHoRZhpj-UojfEvBAht0C90Rp2bwcN8W3nwpJfxHhqHbpLnMKBPOg3qmaK8HjYMoESdlzFKS71eqQCckSQf6XbRlRe8d3MiEW-vJdarT2S6yJjr_I4-YHpMXWxnGftBqVGjB=w1038-h1384-s-no-gm?authuser=2\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPttsRQgfE5_sD7qctDUHoRZhpj-UojfEvBAht0C90Rp2bwcN8W3nwpJfxHhqHbpLnMKBPOg3qmaK8HjYMoESdlzFKS71eqQCckSQf6XbRlRe8d3MiEW-vJdarT2S6yJjr_I4-YHpMXWxnGftBqVGjB=w1038-h1384-s-no-gm?authuser=2\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPPnWeErbPaLO_dL5y0wO1LoREmqbTl5IrPQHHa0-zwgcv_GylLnU4zwQnT5R83p5PblpaNNOLbZhBtSMc5snjRd6WD1BtsAsUtI60VNOy53OigcgsFoqCjYXlUMdkeSM9XjRgeMQ7W8UonT-nMRMlv=w1038-h1384-s-no-gm?authuser=2\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-mce-src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPPnWeErbPaLO_dL5y0wO1LoREmqbTl5IrPQHHa0-zwgcv_GylLnU4zwQnT5R83p5PblpaNNOLbZhBtSMc5snjRd6WD1BtsAsUtI60VNOy53OigcgsFoqCjYXlUMdkeSM9XjRgeMQ7W8UonT-nMRM